.TH latency "1" "2026-08-03" "LinuxCNC Documentation" "The Enhanced Machine Controller"
.SH NAME
latency \- window for the RT Latency web application

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B latency

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B latency
opens the RT Latency test web application of
.BR stmakd (1)
in a native window.  It is a symlink to
.BR stmakui (1),
which selects the application by its invocation name; see that page
for the accepted options and environment variables.
.PP
The latency test itself is normally started with
.BR latency-test (1).

.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR stmakui (1),
.BR latency-test (1),
.BR stmakd (1)

